{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And it was after the plague.</b> HaShem said to Moses and to Eleazar by the hand of Moses. And likewise: \"Moses and the elders of Israel commanded\"; \"Then Moses and the children of Israel sang.\"" "The sense of <b>after the plague</b> is because HaShem said, \"To these the land shall be divided.\""], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {0 "The three proof-texts (Deut. 27:11; Exod. 15:1) are cited to show that Moses' name can appear alongside others while he remains the primary agent of the divine command."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:19:32.457437350Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}